self.KB_CONTENT["card:792759"]={"id":"card:792759","ty":"card","sourceId":"792759","title":"『產品成本建立作業』中的『材料成本 (ME007)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"進貨","keywords":["進貨","生產","材料","單位"],"y":"other","answer":"* 該產品該月份之總投入材料成本。* 材料成本之單位成本=材料成本/(生產入庫+託外進貨+材料在製約量)。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:791677"]={"id":"card:791677","ty":"card","sourceId":"791677","title":"『零用金轉撥建立作業』中的『確認者 (TA011)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"轉撥","keywords":["轉撥"],"y":"other","answer":"* 此欄位僅作顯示，自動顯示人員名稱。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
