self.KB_CONTENT["card:792690"]={"id":"card:792690","ty":"card","sourceId":"792690","title":"『受訂確認書』中的『選擇訂單日期 (COP.TC003)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"訂單","keywords":["訂單","期間"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可選擇(icon)或[F2]日期快手查詢所需列印之國外訂單期間。空白表所有期間均納入範圍。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
